Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: MissionDebug backend API + session index
 FastAPI service that indexes captured MCAP sessions, serves them to the
 web UI, and exposes admin endpoints (rescan, disk usage, retention
 sweep). Pairs with missiondebug-agent (which captures sessions) and
